title: Owner_Act1
---
Owner: Hello!
Owner: You're new here, aren't you? I don't think I've seen you around before.
Owner: Welcome to Yeti's Lawn! I am the Owner of this place.
Owner: I see you already have your skis.
Owner: It's a lovely day, friend. Enjoy the mountain!
===

title: Owner_Act2_NoClue
---
Owner: ...
Owner: Sorry, friend, did you need to say something?
Owner: The silence is quite nice, don't you think? 
Owner: It's a lovely day, friend. Enjoy the mountain.
===

title: Owner_Act2_WithClue
---
Owner: ... Wow.
Owner: I... I had no idea they...
Owner: ...
Owner: This isn't enough... even with... this. 
Owner: This place suffers relying on natural snowfall, even if we haven't had it the worst because of the high altitude were at.
Owner: At the end of the day, I want Yeti's Lawn alive.
-> What if I found something else?
    Owner: If you found something else?
    Owner: ... It depends on what you find, but I would give it a good thinking.
Owner: It's a lovely day, friend. Enjoy the mountain.
===

