title: Owner_Act4
---
Owner: Hello!
Owner: Listen, friend... I wanted to thank you.
Owner: I think I was blinded by my love of the resort, I want this resort to mourn me, not the other way around.
Owner: I see you have your skis.
Owner: It's a lovely day, friend. Enjoy the mountain!
===
